in Mumbai and staging a heist to pay off his defense lawyers. Her husband died testing a bomb. Bhagat Singh went to gallows. She was widowed at 22. She outlived them all. She refused a political career, opened a school for poor children in Lucknow and taught quietly [music] until 1992. She bought guns for revolution and never asked India for anything back."}}